OBJECTIVE: 
1) To represent an EV charging network using a graph.

2) To implement Depth First Search (DFS) for traversing the network.

3)To allow the user to select any starting vertex.

4) To identify reachable and unreachable charging stations.

5) To identify isolated vertices with no connections.

6) To implement Breadth First Search (BFS) to calculate the level of each reachable station.

7) To count the total number of reachable charging stations.
